WEBVTT

00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:02.394
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you have any brothers or sisters?

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:04.066
<v><b>B:</b></v> I have one sister.

00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:06.339
<v><b>A:</b></v> I have one brother, Adam.

00:00:06.392 --> 00:00:08.696
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh cool, tell me about him.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:10.201
Is he like you?

00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:12.130
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, he’s very different.

00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:15.059
He’s quite a bit older than me, he’s thirty-one.

00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:16.851
<v><b>B:</b></v> What does he look like?

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:18.917
<v><b>A:</b></v> So, he’s quite tall.

00:00:19.164 --> 00:00:22.491
He’s not overweight, but I’d say he’s well-built

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:23.805
– he goes to the gym a lot.

00:00:24.305 --> 00:00:26.701
He had dark curly hair when he was younger,

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:30.390
but now he doesn’t really have any hair, he’s bald.

00:00:30.926 --> 00:00:36.460
I think he’s good-looking – he has big dark eyes, and he’s very warm and friendly,

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:38.655
he always has a smile on his face.

00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:40.539
What about your sister?

00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:41.812
What’s her name?

00:00:42.073 --> 00:00:45.530
<v><b>B:</b></v> She’s called Melanie, but we all call her Mel.

00:00:45.613 --> 00:00:46.790
<v><b>A:</b></v> Does she look like you?

00:00:46.806 --> 00:00:47.622
<v><b>B:</b></v> A bit.

00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:52.110
She’s not very tall, I suppose about one metre seventy,

00:00:52.393 --> 00:00:55.973
and she’s normal weight, not thin, but slim.

00:00:56.405 --> 00:01:00.622
She has very long hair, blonde, and she has green eyes.

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:03.794
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s she like? I mean, as a person?

00:01:04.025 --> 00:01:06.424
<v><b>B:</b></v> She’s quite quiet and serious,

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:10.067
but when you get to know her she’s actually very funny.

00:01:10.146 --> 00:01:12.627
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you think she and Adam would get on?

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:13.906
<v><b>B:</b></v> Perhaps?

00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:18.585
Let’s all have dinner together one day, you, me, and Adam and Mel.

00:01:18.585 --> 00:01:19.441
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good idea.